SUMMARY:Viola Vainglory presents BURLESK: Rose Martel & Betsey Bits
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a little spice for your Wednesday night? Join us for an up close and personal burlesque show at Sid’s! We’ve got burlesque beauties\, trivia and even prizes! Be seduced by the sparkle\, Wednesdays from 8:00 – 9:00 pm. \n$7 cover (added to tab). Two item minimum for table/piano seating. \n\nSponsored by\n \nTIP YOUR PERFORMERS!! Venmo @ViolaVainglory \n  \n  \nHost: Viola Vainglory\n \n 
