SUMMARY:Piano Karaoke with Stefan Kukurugya
DESCRIPTION:How it works:\nTip Stefan!\nCheck out Stefan’s song list!\nMake a request!\n\nStefan is a versatile performer and vocalist as a solo artist or with a band and has a diverse repertoire including Jazz\, Pop\, R&B\, and Classical. His vocal styles range from Jazz and Blues\, R&B to Motown and other popular songs. As a bandleader\, Stefan instinctively knows how to work the crowd and keep the party going! More info: detroitpiano.com
