SUMMARY:Happy Hour Karaoke with Matt Eyles
DESCRIPTION:How it works:\nCheck out Matt’s list and make a request!\n \nMatt Eyles is an instrumentalist\, singer\, composer and arranger originally from New Jersey. He has spent the last year playing and singing at Vino Veritas in Dublin\, IE\, while also arranging for choirs/orchestras and producing for artists. You can find him on Instagram @matteyles23!
