SUMMARY:Piano Karaoke with Wendy Ip
DESCRIPTION:How it works!\nTip Wendy here!\nCheck out Wendy’s song list!\nMake a request here!\n\nSinger/songwriter/pianist Wendy Ip is a resident pianist at Sid Gold’s Request Room in New York City. She has released 3 albums\, “Fan Favorites So Far”\, “A Different Kind of Life” and “The Ip EP” all available on iTunes and Spotify. She was featured on VH1’s “Bad Girls” and has toured as pianist and backup singer with the original “bad girl” herself\, Ronnie Spector. Wendy has also worked with Gene Simmons\, and her song “Take Me Away” was featured on A&E’s “Simmons Family Jewels”. She recently accompanied Kelly Clarkson at her album release party for “Chemistry”. Wendy is a cast singer of the bimonthly “Losers Lounge” show at Joe’s Pub and she is currently working on new original material for a long-awaited 4th album. Follow her on Instagram @therealwendyip
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-16-33-47/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Washington DC\, 1262 5th St NE\, Washington\, DC\, 48226\, United States
